%% Berry Exchange — C4 Level 2: Containers
graph TB
    subgraph Client
        Browser["React SPA<br/>(Buyer & Seller UI)"]
    end
    subgraph Edge
        Proxy["Reverse Proxy (Caddy)<br/>TLS, static hosting, /api/* routing"]
    end
    subgraph Backend
        API["ASP.NET Core Web API<br/>Berry Exchange"]
    end
    subgraph Data
        DB[("PostgreSQL")]
    end

    Browser <-->|HTTPS| Proxy
    Proxy -->|serves SPA bundle| Browser
    Proxy -->|"/api/* reverse-proxied"| API
    API -->|"EF Core / Npgsql"| DB
